+  over the same loops `pgen_nt` sums, so the D obeys `p_d_given_j` (TRBD2×TRBJ1 = 0). Coordinates
+  are 0-based half-open in CDR3-nt space. `infer_nt_bruteforce(model, cdr3_aa, v=, j=)` is an exact
